{text:"\n"},{text:"hearing screams here"},{text:"\n"},{text:"and there, then it"},{text:"\n"},{text:"is silent. Some are"},{text:"\n"},{text:"completely losing"},{text:"\n"},{text:"their mind over"},{text:"\n"},{text:"here. A physicist"},{text:"\n"},{text:"came to me earlier,"},{text:"\n"},{text:"he spoke about a"},{text:"\n"},{text:"fright he had. A big"},{text:"\n"},{text:"eye wanted to eat"},{text:"\n"},{text:"him …"},{text:"\n"}],text:""}},{raw:{"extra":[{text:"We had some"},{text:"\n"},{text:"seriously injured"},{text:"\n"},{text:"people. I don’t know"},{text:"\n"},{text:"what is going on but"},{text:"\n"},{text:"I must admit that"},{text:"\n"},{text:"the hypothesis that"},{text:"\n"},{text:"Camille submitted"},{text:"\n"},{text:"doesn’t seem that"},{text:"\n"},{text:"eccentric anymore."},{text:"\n"},{text:"Something wants to"},{text:"\n"},{text:"stop us from going"},{text:"\n"},{text:"any further… unless"},{text:"\n"},{text:"the entire crew is"},{text:"\n"},{text:"now in fantasyland"},{text:"\n"}],text:""}},{raw:{text:"",extra:[{text:"due to the"},{text:"\n"},{text:"conditioning and the"},{text:"\n"},{text:"tension we have been"},{text:"\n"},{text:"facing for a few"},{text:"\n"},{text:"weeks."},{text:"\n"},{text:""},{text:"\n"},{text:"I never thought I"},{text:"\n"},{text:"would say this but"},{text:"\n"},{text:"if I am still able"},{text:"\n"},{text:"to fill this journal"},{text:"\n"},{text:"now, it is because"},{text:"\n"},{text:"of Camille."},{text:"\n"},{text:""},{text:"\n"},{text:""},{text:"\n"}]}}],title:{raw:"§fShip's log 7"}},minecraft:custom_data={Rarity:"misc"}]

give @s minecraft:written_book[minecraft:lore=[{text:"§72489/02/12"},'{text:"§7按照Íthax的时间"}],minecraft:written_book_content={author:"Cpt. Ernesto",pages:[{raw:{"extra":[{text:"这次机动操作失败了。那个物体自身改变了轨道，就是为了追上我们。撞击情况倒没有我们预想的那么糟糕。有几处物质性的损坏需要留意：现在实验室有一部分已经失压，直接暴露在太空之中了。那团物质似乎卡在了船舱上。我不喜欢这样的情况，有时候我甚至觉得这个东西是有生命的。我不许自己去相信如此荒谬的事，可现在似乎没人在意这些了。"}],text:""}},{raw:{"extra":[{text:"我担心我们可能得启用虫洞发生器来摆脱这种局面了，尽管这会再次让我们彻底失去动力。我们已经别无选择了；更多的团状物开始朝飞船靠近，很快我们就会动弹不得了。我还没来得及启动机动操作，动力就中断了。我听到四处传来尖叫声，随后便是一片死寂。这儿有些人完全陷入了疯狂。早前有一位物理学家来找我，他说起自己遭遇的一件可怕的事。一只大眼睛想要把他吃掉……"}],text:""}},{raw:{"extra":[{text:"我们有一些人伤势严重。我不清楚到底是怎么回事，但我必须承认，Camille提出的那个假设现在看来也不那么离奇了。有什么东西想要阻止我们继续前行……除非是因为这几周来我们一直面临的这种紧张状况和身心压力，导致全体船员现在都陷入了幻想之中。我从没想过我会这么说，但如果我现在还能在这本日志上记录的话，那都是因为Camille。"}],text:""}}],title:{raw:"§f飞船日志P7【汉化版】"}},minecraft:custom_data={Rarity:"misc"}]
